<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Helvetica', sans-serif; color: #1e293b; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .header { background-color: #396f5b; color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 26px; }
        .content { padding: 40px; }
        .info-block { margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .info-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .patient-box { background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 30px; border-left: 5px solid #396f5b; }
        .prescription-title { font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #396f5b; }
        .prescription-content { line-height: 1.6; }
        .footer { position: fixed; bottom: 30px; left: 0; right: 0; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 10px; }
        .signature { margin-top: 60px; text-align: right; padding-right: 50px; }
        .signature-line { border-top: 1px solid #1e293b; width: 150px; display: inline-block; margin-top: 50px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>ORDONNANCE MÉDICALE — EVOLIA</h1>
        <div style="font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.8; margin-top: 5px;">Plateforme de Santé Intégrée</div>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <table style="width: 100%;" class="info-block">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 70%;">
                    <strong>Docteur :</strong> {{ doctorName }}<br>
                    <strong>ID :</strong> #{{ consultation.id }}
                </td>
                <td style="text-align: right;">
                    <strong>Date :</strong> {{ date|date('d/m/Y') }}
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="patient-box">
            <div style="font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 5px;">Patient(e)</div>
            <strong style="font-size: 18px;">{{ patientName|upper }}</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="prescription-title">PRESCRIPTIONS & POSOLOGIE</div>
        
        <div class="prescription-content">
            {% if consultation.ordonnance %}
                {{ consultation.ordonnance|nl2br }}
            {% else %}
                <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-style: italic;">Aucune prescription spécifique.</span>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="signature">
            <strong>Signature & Cachet</strong><br>
            <div class="signature-line"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        Document généré électroniquement par l'agent Evolia Elite le {{ date|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}.<br>
        Ce document fait foi de dossier médical officiel.
    </div>
</body>
</html>
